        "title": "Struttura della pagina web",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 144811,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un elemento è ciò che chiamiamo tag di apertura, tag di chiusura e codice al loro interno.</p><p>Quale di questi è un <strong>elemento</strong>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&lt;button&gt;Avvia il gioco&lt;/button&gt;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;button&gt;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;h1&gt;</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;/p&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>&lt;button&gt;Avvia il gioco&lt;/button&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 144812,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifica un elemento <code>h1</code> che visualizzi <code>My First Game</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;button&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/video&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My First Game\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code>, seguito da <code>My First Game</code> e infine <code>&lt;/h1&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 144813,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per creare una pagina web, ti serviranno un tag HTML di apertura e uno di chiusura. Quale di queste opzioni creerà una pagina web HTML <strong>vuota</strong>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&lt;html&gt; &lt;/html&gt;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;button&gt; &lt;/button&gt;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;h1&gt; &lt;/h1&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>&lt;html&gt; &lt;/html&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 144814,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea una pagina web scrivendo il codice di un elemento <code>html</code>.</p><p>Ricorda che possiamo creare un elemento <code>html</code> scrivendo <code>&lt;html&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/html&gt;</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;button&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;h1&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"14\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;html&gt;</code>, seguito da <code>&lt;/html&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 144815,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gli elementi <code>html</code> e <code>body</code> formano la struttura di una pagina web. Inseriamo all'interno del body gli elementi che vogliamo visualizzare.</p><p>Più avanti imparerai a conoscere altri elementi che vanno all'interno di <code>&lt;html&gt; &lt;/html&gt;</code> per dare stile alle pagine dei giochi e renderle interattive.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"23\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;body&gt;</code>, seguito da <code>&lt;/body&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 144816,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale di questi codici definisce il corpo di una pagina web?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&lt;body&gt; &lt;/body&gt;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;html&gt; &lt;/html&gt;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;h1&gt; &lt;/h1&gt;</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>&lt;body&gt; &lt;/body&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 144817,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi il codice per l'elemento <code>body</code> di questa pagina web.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"9\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;</code>, seguito da <code>body</code> e poi <code>&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;/</code>, <code>body</code>, <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 144818,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dobbiamo inserire i contenuti, come le intestazioni, all'interno dei tag body. Visualizza un'intestazione nella pagina web.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"33\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Level 1\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code>, seguito da <code>Level 1</code> e infine <code>&lt;/h1&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 144819,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi il tag di apertura per visualizzare un pulsante nella pagina web.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"25\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Play\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>&lt;button&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 144820,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Visualizza un paragrafo sotto l'intestazione nella pagina web.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"59\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Player Stats\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Health: 100\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;p&gt;</code>, seguito da <code>Health: 100</code> e infine <code>&lt;/p&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
